    "Couldn't send right now. Try again, or email us directly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时发送失败，请重试，或直接发邮件给我们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发邮件至 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send Feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks! Feedback sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已收到，谢谢！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SessionBell pairs with your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SessionBell 需要和你的 Mac 配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It puts the Claude Code sessions running on your Mac onto this phone's Lock Screen. The next step is one line in the Mac's Terminal — about 30 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它把 Mac 上正在跑的 Claude Code 搬到这台手机的锁屏。下一步要在 Mac 的终端里粘一行命令，大约 30 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm at my Mac now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我现在就在 Mac 前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not right now — show me the demo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在不在，先看看演示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My Mac is showing a 6-digit code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 屏幕上有一个 6 位数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste this one line into Terminal on your Mac and press Return": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这一行粘到 Mac 的终端里，按回车"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied — now ⌘V on the Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制，去 Mac 上 ⌘V"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制这一行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't copy across? Just type it — the number is %@. Valid for 15 minutes; it renews by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制不过去？照着敲也行，数字是 %@。15 分钟内有效，过期会自动换新的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal is in Applications › Utilities, or press ⌘Space and type Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端在「应用程序 › 实用工具」里，或者按 ⌘空格 输入 Terminal。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From now on, when Claude Code stops and waits for you, a card shows up on this Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从现在起，Claude Code 停下来等你时，这台手机的锁屏上会出现一张卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the Mac… this page moves on by itself once it's done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等 Mac 那边跑完……好了这页会自己跳走。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet? Make sure the whole line was pasted and you pressed Return. If the Mac asked for permission, allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没反应？确认整行都粘进去了、按了回车。Mac 如果弹出权限询问，点允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "然后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "483 920": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "483 920"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接中……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 6 digits on the Mac screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 屏幕上的 6 位数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They appear in Terminal and in the browser page that opened after the command finished. Scanning that page's QR code with the Camera app fills this in for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令跑完后终端里和自动打开的网页上都有。用相机扫那个网页上的二维码，这里会自动填好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have a long pairing code or a self-hosted server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我有一长串配对码 / 自己部署的服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac isn't connected yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Mac 还没接上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One line in Terminal and your Claude Code sessions land on this Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端里粘一行命令，Claude Code 的会话就会出现在这块锁屏上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the 6 digits shown on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 Mac 上显示的 6 位数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac sent something unexpected. Run the command on the Mac again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 返回的内容不对。在 Mac 上重新跑一遍那行命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code was already used. Run the command on the Mac again for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个数字已经用过了。在 Mac 上重新跑一遍命令，会给一个新的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired or isn't right. Check the Mac screen and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个数字过期了或者不对。看一眼 Mac 屏幕再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many tries. Wait a minute and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试得太多了，等一分钟再来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected to a Mac yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没连上 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These tasks are a demo. When you're back at your Mac, tap below — it's one line in Terminal, about 30 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些任务是演示数据。回到 Mac 前时点下面这个按钮，终端里粘一行命令，大约 30 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied — paste it in Terminal on the other Mac (valid 15 min)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制，粘到另一台 Mac 的终端里（15 分钟内有效）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add another Mac (copy the one-line command)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再加一台 Mac（复制那行命令）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode · Connect my Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "演示模式 · 连接我的 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected. This card fills in when Claude Code next stops for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接。Claude Code 下次停下来等你时，这张卡会显示具体任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset and Start Over": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置并重新开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forgets the pairing on this phone and returns to the first screen, as if freshly installed. Your Macs keep their setup; pair again to reconnect them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "忘掉这台手机上的配对，回到第一屏，就像刚装上一样。Mac 那边的设置保留，重新配对即可再接上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset SessionBell on this phone?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置这台手机上的 SessionBell？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing, history and Lock Screen cards on this phone are removed. Nothing is deleted on your Macs or the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会清掉这台手机上的配对、历史记录和锁屏卡片。Mac 和服务器上的东西不会被删。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-hosted server / advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自己部署的服务器 / 高级选项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the 6 digits from the Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 Mac 上的那 6 位数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already ran a command on the Mac and it shows 6 digits?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上已经跑过这行命令、屏幕上出现了 6 位数字？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Digits from the Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上的数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the command finishes on the Mac, the digits are printed in Terminal and shown on the web page that opens. Scanning that page's QR code with the Camera app fills them in for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上命令跑完后，数字会打印在终端里，也显示在自动打开的网页上。用相机扫那个网页上的二维码，这里会自动填好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email or any handle — X, Discord… (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "邮箱或微信（选填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send to the Mac with AirDrop instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用 AirDrop 发到 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste didn't arrive on the Mac? AirDrop opens a page there with a copy button. Or just type it — the number is %@. Valid for 15 minutes; it renews by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上粘不出来？AirDrop 过去会打开一个带复制按钮的网页。或者照着敲，数字是 %@。15 分钟内有效，过期会自动换新的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One line in Terminal on your Mac, about 30 seconds. Tap below when you're in front of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 的终端里粘一行命令，大约 30 秒。人到 Mac 前了就点下面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look up: the panel is already in the Dynamic Island. Lock the phone and it's on the Lock Screen too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抬头看，面板已经在灵动岛里了。锁上屏幕，锁屏上也有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From now on it fills in whenever Claude Code stops and waits for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从现在起，Claude Code 停下来等你时，它就会显示具体任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch this phone to another Mac?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这台手机切到另一台 Mac？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch and pair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换并配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone is already paired. Entering the new code moves it to that Mac's space; the current Mac stops showing up until you pair it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台手机已经配过对了。输入新数字会把它切到那台 Mac 的空间，当前的 Mac 会消失，直到你再次配对它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced · Self-hosted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级 · 自托管"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected Macs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接的 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Awake · tap to stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常亮中 · 点一下取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Mac awake": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持 Mac 常亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start a task on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上开新任务"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
